{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-characterizing-finite-type-presentation}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d9f9a550fbb273b9d63c4bb2cc934d959816c3db64caac0da70fbab6f98d09a2", "source_text": "Characterizing modules of finite type and finite presentation", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fdf1e615ed80744ae66d1bce5311921da074bded9516e1e29069e1fbb6749a0c", "unit_id": "tag:01PA:title"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Spec(A) = U \\subset X$", "MATH_0007": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0008": "$A$", "MATH_0009": "$M$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\Spec(A) = U \\subset X$", "MATH_0013": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0014": "$A$", "MATH_0015": "$M$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-definition-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{modules-definition-finite-presentation}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e2ce274ad11c24f696b55358b200e70b11c9d9b0272d78b6ee239c2664d00d1a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:14ab1d20fe5a3a720c7797282149550e4e287ca8eb4e347b0138e23999d66134", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0003>-module.\nThe following lemma implies that <MATH_0004> is of finite type\n(see Modules, Definition <REF_0001>)\nif and only if <MATH_0005> is\non each open affine <MATH_0006>\nof the form <MATH_0007> for some finite <MATH_0008>-module <MATH_0009>.\nSimilarly, <MATH_0010> is of finite presentation\n(see Modules, Definition <REF_0002>)\nif and only if <MATH_0011> is\non each open affine <MATH_0012>\nof the form <MATH_0013> for some finitely presented <MATH_0014>-module <MATH_0015>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3e9f04980559003e530bbbdc2a2f176a2345dcadf646b6cf3fe6fabee4e3409b", "unit_id": "tag:01PA:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0005": "$M$", "MATH_0006": "$R$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-type-module}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:191bf435e456e786618992ef990eca09baf4b4fd3617540b38a1fe27c35fc2c0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0e4020fe036ebc855a50e62da62e9cab16c040a05fd85d53136f8a1f11f4b6d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an affine scheme.\nThe quasi-coherent sheaf of <MATH_0002>-modules\n<MATH_0003> is a finite type <MATH_0004>-module\nif and only if <MATH_0005> is a finite <MATH_0006>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3449bf2d7f7064494235386b118124bbeec5938e9e4e7280fe9f61914c018313", "unit_id": "tag:01PB:statement"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0005": "$X = \\bigcup_{i = 1, \\ldots, n} D(f_i)$", "MATH_0006": "$\\widetilde M|_{D(f_i)}$", "MATH_0007": "$M_{f_i}$", "MATH_0008": "$i$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-cover}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2bf50392d5860ac9fcbd93d041b26e3a31ec6eaa447184149e200750b86cce51", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3881240d4c790886746991b2d36182a80f2e85f27a8a91937709693811a300f5", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is a finite type <MATH_0002>-module.\nThis means there exists an open covering of <MATH_0003> such that\n<MATH_0004> restricted to the members of this covering is\nglobally generated by finitely many sections.\nThus there also exists a standard open covering\n<MATH_0005> such that <MATH_0006>\nis generated by finitely many sections. Thus <MATH_0007> is finitely\ngenerated for each <MATH_0008>. Hence we conclude by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1df07faf1f8c75c39664f901f775a900653e9ea19d8e3a1f7d7a880d1bc86a07", "unit_id": "tag:01PB:proof"}
